WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:23.480
For the Separatist Alliance!

00:00:27.520 --> 00:00:28.560
We need backup!

00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:29.840
Roger Roger!

00:00:30.540 --> 00:00:31.740
Reinforcements!

00:00:31.740 --> 00:00:32.580
We're outnumbered!

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:35.000
Drop or die!

00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:42.720
Sector is clear.

00:00:43.560 --> 00:00:45.000
Not clear! Not clear!

00:00:56.520 --> 00:00:57.640
Target insight!

00:01:16.540 --> 00:01:25.540
All wings, we're coming up on the star destroyer, but we need to clear that escort! Let's give it everything we got!

00:01:31.480 --> 00:01:34.360
Here are your next assignments they are...

00:01:36.320 --> 00:01:36.820
Unusual.

00:01:38.900 --> 00:01:39.660
Grab onto something!

00:01:39.660 --> 00:01:40.460
I'm trying!

